  "details": "The VRC Animator Temporary Pose Space component is broken in stations the latest VRChat Avatar Scaling update.\n\nI tested multiple things.\n\nBut the easiest way to reproduce is just to set up a new Avatar with the latest SDK.\n\nUsing all the default Animator Layers and then launch VRChat in Desktop mode and find a station you can sit in.\n\nIt moves the viewpoint high in the air above your seat.\n\nThis bug does not occur in VR, because the viewpoint is not modified there.",
